    "title": "The History of Shilajit in Ayurveda",
    "metaTitle": "The History of Shilajit: 3,000 Years of Use",
    "metaDesc": "Shilajit's journey through classical Ayurveda and beyond, and how tradition informs modern use.",
    "keyword": "shilajit history",
