        "body": "The long tradition behind shilajit is not just a story — it carries practical guidance. The classical insistence on proper source, purification and quality control is echoed by modern concerns about heavy metals and adulteration in poorly processed products. Tradition and safety science point in the same direction here.\n\nThis is why a doctor-led approach matters: honouring what centuries of use suggest, while holding it to modern standards of purity, testing and sensible expectation. Shilajit's history earns it serious attention — and equally, it earns careful, evidence-aware handling."
