    "intro": "\"Shilajit is a powerful antioxidant\" is one of the most repeated lines online — but repetition is not proof. As a BAMS physician, I think it helps to slow down and separate the plausible chemistry from the confirmed clinical benefit.\n\nIn this article I'll explain the antioxidant rationale for Shilajit, what fulvic acid and its other compounds may do, and — just as importantly — where the current human evidence is thin. The goal is honest clarity, not hype.",
