    "title": "How to Read a Shilajit Lab Report",
    "metaTitle": "How to Read a Shilajit Lab Report (COA Guide)",
    "metaDesc": "A plain-English walkthrough of a Shilajit COA — heavy metals, microbial safety and fulvic % with method.",
    "keyword": "shilajit lab report",
