    "intro": "If you already down a protein shake after training, adding Shilajit can feel like an easy upgrade. And it can be — but only if you do it right. Get it wrong and you end up with gritty lumps stuck to the glass, a metallic aftertaste, or resin that never quite dissolved.\n\nThis is a practical, step-by-step guide to combining Shilajit resin with your shake. We'll keep the claims modest and the method sound, so you actually enjoy the drink and don't waste a single pea of that precious resin.",
