    "metaTitle": "What Is Ayurveda? Principles, History & How It Works",
    "metaDesc": "A modern, doctor-led introduction to Ayurveda — doshas, Agni, dhatus and how the system approaches health.",
    "keyword": "what is ayurveda",
    "intent": "Informational",
