      "Disease is often framed as a flow problem — excess, blockage, abnormal growths, or misdirection (srotodushti) — commonly linked to ama accumulation.",
      "Clear channels depend on strong agni and everyday habits: mindful eating, hydration, movement, breath, sleep and stress management.",
