    "intro": "In Ayurveda, two words come up again and again: Prakriti and Vikriti. They sound similar and both relate to the doshas (Vata, Pitta, Kapha), but they describe very different things. Prakriti is your baseline — the unique dosha blend you were born with. Vikriti is where you are right now, including any imbalance that has crept in through diet, season, stress or lifestyle.\n\nUnderstanding this distinction matters because Ayurveda doesn't treat everyone the same way. It aims to bring your present state (Vikriti) back towards your natural state (Prakriti). This article explains both terms, how a practitioner assesses them, and how balance is gently restored — while being honest about what modern research does and doesn't yet confirm.",
