      "Samprapti describes a staged progression (Shatkriyakala) that shows where a disease can be interrupted early.",
      "Nidana Parivarjana — removing the cause — is considered the first and most practical step of treatment.",
      "These are traditional observational models; modern clinical validation is limited, so use them for understanding, not self-diagnosis."
