    "slug": "pathya-apathya",
    "title": "Pathya and Apathya: Ayurveda's Do's and Don'ts",
    "metaTitle": "Pathya & Apathya: Wholesome vs Unwholesome in Ayurveda",
    "metaDesc": "What makes food and habits Pathya (supportive) or Apathya (harmful), and how to apply it.",
    "keyword": "pathya apathya",
