    "title": "Dravyaguna: How Ayurveda Understands Herbs",
    "metaTitle": "Dravyaguna: The Ayurvedic Science of Medicinal Substances",
    "metaDesc": "How Ayurveda classifies herbs by Rasa, Guna, Virya, Vipaka and Prabhava — the logic behind formulations.",
    "keyword": "dravyaguna",
