        "heading": "Where Shilajit and tonics fit — honestly",
        "body": "Many people turn to traditional rasayana (rejuvenative) substances such as Shilajit as the seasons change, since these transition periods are classically seen as times to support strength and vitality. In Ayurveda, rasayana use is individualised and tied to season, constitution and digestion.\n\nWe make Shilajit products at 3TATTAVA, so we'll be plain: robust modern clinical evidence for Shilajit is still limited and largely preliminary, and it is not a cure or a substitute for medical care. If you wish to use any tonic during a seasonal junction, treat it as an optional supportive habit within a wider healthy routine, choose purified and quality-tested products, and speak to an Ayurvedic or medical practitioner first."
