    "metaTitle": "The Shilajit Flame Test: Does It Actually Work?",
    "metaDesc": "What the flame test shows, why some fakes pass it, and why lab testing is the real answer.",
    "keyword": "shilajit flame test",
    "intent": "HowTo",
