        "heading": "A realistic 'beauty from within' view",
        "body": "So does Shilajit help skin? The honest answer is: it may support the internal conditions associated with healthy skin — antioxidant balance, mineral nutrition, steadier energy — but it is not a proven glow treatment and certainly not a substitute for the basics.\n\nThe fundamentals still do the heavy lifting: good sleep, hydration, a nutrient-rich diet, managing stress, sun protection, and treating any underlying issue like anaemia or thyroid imbalance. If you choose to use Shilajit, treat it as one small, long-term supportive habit within that bigger picture — not as the hero of your skincare routine."
